See AGENTS.md for the canonical project rules.

Hard constraints:
- TypeScript ESM throughout. Node 20.
- Tailwind colors driven by CSS variables (themes). No hardcoded hex in web/src/**.
- Replace native <select> with components/Select.tsx; replace window.confirm with useConfirm.
- Every admin route: requireAuth + requireOrgRole; every mutation: audit(...).
- OAuth scope changes invalidate sessions — coordinate before editing config.ts.
- Doc sync: code change without updating docs (USAGE/ARCHITECTURE/DEPLOY/README) is a review-blocker.
